flowchart TD
  accTitle: Obsidian ERP architecture
  accDescr: ERPNext DocType metadata generates TypeScript types and Zod schemas, which fill a DocType registry. Generic hooks and factory API routes are built from the registry. Next.js pages use the hooks and the flow engine, and every API route calls ERPNext as the signed-in user, so ERPNext's own role permissions apply.

  doctypes["ERPNext DocTypes"] -- generated from metadata --> types["TypeScript types + Zod schemas"]
  types --> registry["DocType registry"]
  registry --> hooks["Generic hooks"]
  registry --> routes["Factory API routes"]
  pages["Next.js App Router pages"] --> hooks
  pages --> flow["Flow engine: FlowRail, one-click chains"]
  hooks --> routes
  flow --> routes
  routes -- as the signed-in user --> erp[("ERPNext v15")]
